polyglot
--------

Parts of SQLQuack's tokenizer and parser, in crates/sqlquack-syntax and
crates/sqlquack-syntax-derive, are derived from polyglot (https://github.com/tobilg/polyglot),
as forked at https://github.com/chio-labs/polyglot. The exact-check corpus
corpora/polyglot-check/polyglot_tests.json holds the SQL inputs of polyglot's tests.

